= Margarita Nelken

Margarita Nelken is an art critic, writer, and one of the first female deputies elected.

- @womens_rights_
- @organizing_women
- @structure_
- @root: Return to main

@womens_rights_
title: Women's rights
subtitle: Enact policy with regards to women's rights.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0 and psoe_in_government
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if not psoe_in_government : The PSOE is not currently in government. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; womens_rights_timer -= 10; last_advisor_action = 1
go-to: womens_rights

@organizing_women
title: Organizing women
subtitle: Focus the sindical efforts on women.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: womens_rights += 1; workers_spd += 4*(1-dissent); rural_spd += 3*(1-dissent); old_middle_spd += 3*(1-dissent); advisor_action_timer = 6

By focusing on working-class mothers, maternity insurance, and workplace nurseries, Nelken cements the loyalty of female industrial and agricultural workers to the socialist movement.

[? if spd_r < 50 : Unfortunately, women still disproportionately support the conservative parties. ?]

@structure_
title: Change the structure and funding of education.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0 and psoe_in_government and chancellor_party = "PSOE"
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if not spd_in_government : The PSOE is not currently in government. ?][? if chancellor_party != "PSOE": The PSOE must control the presidency of the ministers' gabinet. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; last_advisor_action = 1
go-to: education_science.structure
